    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Peekaboo Tales series</strong> is a retro horror anthology chronicling short stories of uncanny childhood events.<strong><br>Part Two: Hide and Sink </strong>tells the story of a little girl playing hide and seek with a group of friends after school, while a happy game descends into unsettling fear as darkness arrives. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Feature:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Authentic VHS Aesthetics: </strong>A gritty CRT filter immerses<strong> you in era-specific terror.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Childhood Horror:</strong>\u00a0Restore some familiar and terrifying childhood fears from the perspective of children.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hide-and-Seek Mechanics:</strong> The core game of reliving hiding and seeking provides an immersive, atmospheric experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story-rich: Exploring multiple endings of the game\u00a0</strong>and the plots behind each character.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Play:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Walk and Investigation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some puzzle-solving elements</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slightly action controlling (Run and Chasing)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Peekaboo Tales series</strong> is a retro horror anthology chronicling short stories of uncanny childhood events.<strong><br>Part Two: Hide and Sink </strong>tells the story of a little girl playing hide and seek with a group of friends after school, while a happy game descends into unsettling fear as darkness arrives. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Feature:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Authentic VHS Aesthetics: </strong>A gritty CRT filter immerses<strong> you in era-specific terror.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Childhood Horror:</strong>\u00a0Restore some familiar and terrifying childhood fears from the perspective of children.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hide-and-Seek Mechanics:</strong> The core game of reliving hiding and seeking provides an immersive, atmospheric experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story-rich: Exploring multiple endings of the game\u00a0</strong>and the plots behind each character.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Play:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Walk and Investigation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some puzzle-solving elements</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slightly action controlling (Run and Chasing)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
